description: Deploy to Firebase Hosting only; never Cloud Run
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deploy policy

- Deploy **Firebase Hosting only** (`firebase deploy --only hosting:...`).
- Do **not** run `gcloud run deploy`, Cloud Run source builds, or Cloud Run revisions unless the user explicitly asks.
- Existing Hosting rewrites to Cloud Run may stay as-is; just do not redeploy those services.
- Frontend/data changes: update static files and Firebase Hosting only.
